ey struck down the Tyrant lurking in the shadows, sealing ==SEX4== away in a god-bestowed stone coffin.",3,""],["bgm","m111"],["w",0.4],["film",1],["stg",0,null,0.0,1.03,"OutCubic",0.8,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_136","a","002",null,0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.8],["show","avg3_216","a","012",0.45,-0.02,1.03,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_216","a",null,null,0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.8],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_216","a",null,"exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["say","avg3_216","Reporting in, Ma'am. The artillery is ready.==W== Oh... Am I interrupting your reading?",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg3_216","a","011","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_136","a","003","music",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_136","It's fine. I was just brushing up on some history...==W== The history of the Tyrant from a long, long time ago.",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_136","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_216","a","004","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_216","The Tyrant was around in ancient times too? I'm ashamed to say that's news to me.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_216","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_136","a","004","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_136","Yes. The history of Nova is an endless cycle of our people rebelling against, defeating, and sealing away the Tyrant.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_136","a","006","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_136","But the Grace Imperium buried this truth. The stories passed down in our schools and cities are nothing but sanitized fairy tales.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_136","a","013","love",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_136","If you're interested, I can lend you a few \"true\" history books once this battle is over.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_216","a","014","shy",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_216","Thank you, Ma'am!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_216","a","011","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg3_216","Honestly, I was pretty on edge about this showdown with the Tyrant.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_216","a","006","happy",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_216","But seeing you sitting here reading so calmly definitely took the edge off.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_216","a","012","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_216","I'll go run a final check on the firing coordinates. I'll hold you to those books when this is over!",0,""],["w",0.4],["cbg",0,-90.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.75,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_216","a",null,null,0.82,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.75],["hide","avg3_216",0.75],["ctl","avg1_136","a","004",null,0.52,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.75],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["say","avg1_136","Nervous, huh...",0,""],["w",0.8],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["clear",0,0,1],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_136","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.1],["se","se_021"],["w",0.25],["say","avg1_136","Why did I dust off this history book ... when I haven't read it in so long?",0,""],["w",0.4],["film",0],["stg",0,null,-70.0,1.17,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["bg","traveller_camp_a_daylight",0,0.7],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_136","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.8],["w",0.15],["show","avg3_1319","b","003",0.75,-0.1,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_1319","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.85,null,"OutCubic",0.85],["w",0.45],["say","avg1_136","Tyrant, watching your journey through Philae might have been the happiest time of my life.",3,""],["w",0.4],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutCubic",0.75,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["ctl","avg3_1319","b",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.75],["hide","avg3_1319",0.75],["film",1],["bg","desert_daylight",0,0.75],["w",0.15],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,"speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_136","If I didn't know how this had to end, we could have been great friends.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_136","a","012","sigh",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.35],["say","avg1_136","Heh. Not that it matters now.",0,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_136","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_136","You woke up in the desert, and it'll all end in the desert. Perhaps this is exactly how the God of Grace designed it.",0,""],["w",0.4],["trn",0,5,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,90.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","mirage_street_2_daylight",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.8,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,null,null,1.0,"OutSine",70.0,null,null,null],["w",0.4],["trn",1,5,false,false,1.0],["se","se_520"],["head","13:15, Nebula Month 18th, Mirage, Near the Crystal Diamond Mine"],["show","avg3_152","a","018",0.46,-0.1,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"manbu_loop","OutSine",70.0],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,"speechless",null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.4],["say","avg3_152","The outsider distributed the Monolith's holy relics to the people, forging a new home in the desert sands.",0,""],["w",0.4],["say","avg3_152","But as wealth was abundant, the people forgot about their past sacrifices. They forgot the outsider, taking their paradise for granted.",0,""],["w",0.4],["say","avg3_152","The outsider was pleased with this outcome. ==SEX1== vanished into the Wilds, never to be seen again.",0,""],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.4],["show","avg1_150","a","010",0.5,-0.1,1.17,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"manbu_loop","Linear",0.0],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,"question",0.32,-0.134,null,1.0,null,"OutBack",0.7],["w",0.4],["bgm","m2"],["say","avg1_150","Bastelina, what are you muttering about over there? I know this heat is driving everyone mad, but save your complaint before you pass out.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_152","a","015","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_152","I'm not complaining. I'm studying for my Grace Theory exam. They expect us to memorize these out-of-context historical passages word for word, and it's giving me a headache.",0,""],["w",0.4],["stg",0,-180.0,null,1.1,"OutCubic",0.75,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_150","a","008","idea",0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutBack",0.85],["w",0.45],["say","avg1_150","Oh, right, I remember now. That's the test all the new hires have to pass within their first year, right?",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","014","sweaty",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Just thinking about it is annoying enough... Why is an exam on Grace Theory packed with a bunch of useless history?",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","004","shock",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","What exactly are you reading, though? I don't remember that being on the syllabus.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_152","a","013","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_152","My supervisor gave me these review materials. Here, it's this book.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","021","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Oh... The supervisor you're always texting for instructions? Let me see...",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.35],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,0.8,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,0.36,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.15],["se","se_021"],["obj","qstory_main_09_001",1,null,0.54],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_150","Chronicles of Nova,==W== and the author is... Huh? It's blank.",0,""],["w",0.75],["ctl","avg1_150","a","009","question",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","025","awkward",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_150","Hmm... Never heard of this one.",0,""],["w",0.2],["objx"],["w",0.2],["se","se_113"],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,0.46,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["ctl","avg1_150","a","011",null,0.7,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Ugh, whatever. This awful sun is melting my brain. I can't focus on a single word anyway. Here, take it back!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","028","flurry",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Hah... We have it so rough. If I knew going undercover meant getting roasted in a desert, I'd have passed on the hazard pay.",0,""],["w",0.4],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_150","a","027","resentful",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","I mean, come on! Fries and deserts do not mix! Why would anyone eat piping hot food in this blistering heat?!",0,""],["w",0.4],["trn",0,1,true,true,0.8],["w",0.8],["bg","mirage_street_2_daylight",0,0.0],["cbg",0,-90.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg3_152","a","007",null,-0.11,1.15,0,null,null],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,0.3,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.0],["show","avg1_150","a","027",null,-0.11,1.15,0,null,null],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,0.72,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.0],["obj","qstory_main_09_002",1,null,0.54],["w",0.25],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.8],["w",0.15],["se","se_084"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_congr",0,1],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_152","Try this, Laru. If you dip the hot fries into cold ice cream, they go down a lot easier.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","015","question",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Fries with ice cream? Fries are great and all, but there is no way that combo works. I'll take a bite, though.",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_341"],["ctl","avg1_150","a","020",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.95],["ctl","avg1_150","a","006","flower",null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["bgm","m28"],["say","avg1_150","... Wait, what is this?! It's incredible! Let me get another bite...",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_341"],["ctl","avg1_150","a","020",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.95],["objx"],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,0.2,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["hide","avg3_152",0.7],["cbg",0,90.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_150","a","010","speechless",0.52,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",2.1],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.35],["w",0.15],["se","se_146"],["ctl","avg1_150","a","027",null,null,null,null,null,"ChanDou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","This salty-sweet, hot-cold combo...==W== It's perfect! The contrasting flavors taste so good together! It replenishes sodium and beats the heat. This is a life-saving miracle!",0,""],["w",0.7],["bg","mood_1",0,0.7],["fx",0,"fx_avg_bubble",0,0],["ctl","avg1_150","a","016",null,null,null,null,null,"tiao2","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["goon"],["w",0.4],["bg","mirage_street_2_daylight",0,0.7],["cbg",0,-90.0,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,90.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["show","avg3_152","a","007",0.5,-0.1,1.15,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,0.64,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["ctl","avg1_150","a","013","love",0.36,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_150","Sweet and salty, cold and hot... It's absolute perfection! Bastelina, you're a genius! A visionary!",0,""],["w",0.4],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg3_152","a","010","shy",null,null,null,null,"youzai","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_152","Heh, the perks of working logistics. I just combined the ice meant for the Committee with your fry stash, and came up with this.",0,""],["w",0.4],["stg",0,-250.0,null,1.15,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["show","avg1_136","a","002",0.82,-0.15,1.21,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,0.9,null,null,0.75,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["ctl","avg3_152","a","013","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_152","Still... Angie is awfully trusting...",0,""],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.4],["stg",0,0.0,null,1.08,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_136","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["hide","avg1_136",0.7],["w",0.2],["ctl","avg1_150","a","012","happy",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["bgm","m79"],["say","avg1_150","Hmph. The Salvation Committee just got branded as heretics, and we're the only ones crazy enough to side with them right now.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_152","a","015",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["ctl","avg1_150","a","007","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","So Angie can't afford to give us the cold shoulder. Even if she suspects us, she has to treat the brave weirdos well. Doing anything else would tank morale.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","013","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Logistics is important, sure, but for this operation? Compared to the front lines hunting the Tyrant, this is the least critical post.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","020",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","We're stuck in the middle of the desert without our phones, surrounded by Committee members. We couldn't send intel or sabotage them if we tried.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","006","star",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Which means we can kick back and slack off guilt-free!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_152","a","018","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_152","Can we really, though? If Angie captures the Tyrant, Lady Albedo will be purged for opposing her, won't she?",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","021","speechless",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Whoa! You're right...! Angie will have a hundred ways to force ==PLAYER_NAME== to confess that ==SEX=='s the world-destroying Tyrant...",0,""],["ctl","avg1_150","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","015","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_150","Then the heresy charges would disappear, and Albedo would definitely be the first to take the fall. Wait, they might even frame her as the Tyrant's accomplice!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","019","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Which means it's only a matter of time before our cover gets blown too!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_152","a","015","awkward",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_152","At that point, getting fired by the Grace Imperium would be the best-case scenario.",0,""],["w",0.4],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["cbg",0,-90.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,0.76,null,null,0.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["hide","avg3_152",0.7],["ctl","avg1_150","a","011",null,0.51,-0.18,1.25,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg1_150","Fired?! No way! How am I supposed to slack off at work if I'm unemployed?! We are avoiding that timeline!",0,""],["w",0.4],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.25,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["bg","mood_4",0,0.7],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_150","a","028",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","There has to be a way... Come on, Laru, use that big brain of yours. Think…",0,""],["w",0.4],["bg","mirage_street_2_daylight",0,0.7],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.25],["ctl","avg1_150","a","010","idea",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","I got it!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","018","flower",0.35,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["show","avg3_152","a","013",null,-0.16,1.24,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg3_152","a",null,null,0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.7],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_150","Bastelina! Our mission is to feed intel to Albedo, right? And Albedo's goal is to help ==PLAYER_NAME==.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_150","a","006","music",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","We don't have phones, so we can't reach Albedo. But we're already right here in Mirage! We can just go meet ==PLAYER_NAME==!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_152","a","015","question",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg3_152","Can we really do that? It feels like... Like we're skipping some major protocols.",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg1_150","a","019","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_150","Don't sweat the details! As long as we cross the finish line, taking a shortcut doesn't matter!",0,""],["w",0.4],["ctl","avg3_152","a","014",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["ctl","avg1_150","a","013","love",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["bgm",""